  "title": "[Radio’ Clock] Tea Time Monday with Sophie (소피)",
  "description": "들려주고 싶은 이야기가 너~무 많아서 한 시간이 너무 짧게 느껴졌던 크리스 존슨과의 시간이었는데요\r\n한국에 정착할 수 있는 팁도 알려주고, 퀴즈도 맞춰봤는데요..!\r\n여러분은 정답 알고 계셨나요.?\r\n한국에 정착하는 꿀팁은 무엇인지, 퀴즈 정답은 무엇일지 맞춰보세요~!\r\n\r\nAn hour with Kris Johnson felt too short because there were so many stories to share.\r\nHe gave tips on settling down in Korea, and even solved quizzes!\r\nDid you all know the answers?\r\nLet's check out the tips for settling in Korea and the answers to the quiz!\r\n\r\n▶Subscribe Arirang Radio: https://www.youtube.com/Music180Arirang\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\nThe first English broadcasting radio station in Korea, ARIRANG RADIO.\r\nWe broadcast a variety of Korean culture including K-Pop music as well as news and useful information 24 hours a day.\r\n#소피 #Sophie #피트니스강사",
